Title: Quantifying the effect of baryon physics on weak lensing tomography
Authors: Elisabetta Semboloni, Henk Hoekstra,
[usage]
[tool] d-01 cite {"arxiv_id": "1104.1174", "bib_path": "/Users/nramachandra/hep-genesis-testing/projects/ramp-research-baryonic-pk/runs/261017_110039/references.bib", "note": "[
