[finding] f-013 Elbers+2024 (FLAMINGO, arXiv:2403.12967): baryonic feedback is coupled to cosmology through f_b/c_v^2 ~ f_b/(Omega_m sigma8)^(1/4), which gives an accurate fitt
**Finding:** Elbers+2024 (FLAMINGO, arXiv:2403.12967): baryonic feedback is coupled to cosmology through f_b/c_v^2 ~ f_b/(Omega_m sigma8)^(1/4), which gives an accurate fitting formula for the suppression. Combined baryonic and non-baryonic suppression (neutrinos, decaying DM) is larger than the sum of its parts.
