[finding] f-016 Literature value, not computed (BCemu, Giri and Schneider, arXiv:2108.08863, Sec. 4.2 text): S(k, z=0) inferred from X-ray gas fractions, with the 7-parameter B
**Finding:** Literature value, not computed (BCemu, Giri and Schneider, arXiv:2108.08863, Sec. 4.2 text): S(k, z=0) inferred from X-ray gas fractions, with the 7-parameter BCemu posterior at log10 Mc ~ 12.6, Planck cosmology and b_hse = 0.26+-0.07. At 68% CL, suppression first exceeds 1% at k~0.1-0.4 h/Mpc and reaches a maximum of 21-28% (S_min ~0.72-0.79) at k_min ~7 h/Mpc; the abstract rounds this to 20-28%. At 99% CL, k(1%) lies between 0.1 and 1.3 h/Mpc and the maximum is 14-38% (S_min ~0.62-0.86) beyond k~7 h/Mpc. The posterior pushes delta low, meaning a slowly falling gas profile with large amounts of gas ejected beyond the virial radius.
