[finding] f-018 OWLS AGN (van Daalen+2011, arXiv:1104.1174), verbatim abstract: the AGN run 'predicts a decrease in power relative to a dark matter only simulation ranging, at 
**Finding:** OWLS AGN (van Daalen+2011, arXiv:1104.1174), verbatim abstract: the AGN run 'predicts a decrease in power relative to a dark matter only simulation ranging, at z = 0, from 1% at k ≈ 0.3 h Mpc−1 to 10% at k ≈ 1 h Mpc−1 and to 30% at k ≈ 10 h Mpc−1', and cooling 'is the dominant effect only for k ≳ 70 h Mpc−1'. So S(k=1)~0.90 and S(k=10)~0.70. In the bracket it is labelled INTERMEDIATE: it sits stronger than FLAMINGO fiducial and Horizon-AGN, and below the strongest cosmo-OWLS runs.
