[finding] f-019 FLAMINGO (Schaller+, arXiv:2410.17109), verbatim text quotes. (1) Fiducial: 'The position of the minimum of the response moves from k = 6 h·Mpc−1 at z = 2 to k 
**Finding:** FLAMINGO (Schaller+, arXiv:2410.17109), verbatim text quotes. (1) Fiducial: 'The position of the minimum of the response moves from k = 6 h·Mpc−1 at z = 2 to k = 10 h·Mpc−1 at z = 0', and the departure from unity begins at 'k≈ 0.1 h·Mpc−1 by z = 0'. (2) Thermal fgas variants: 'the minimum stays in the range k = 8 to 10 h·Mpc−1 with a weak dependence on fgas±Nσ'. Below fgas−8σ the response 'reaches a saturation value'. (3) Jet: 'At fixed value of fgas±Nσ, the emulator predicts a larger response than in the case with purely thermal AGN'. (4) The strong end maps to cosmo-OWLS: 'our models with fgas−8σ using the thermal and jet models closely resemble the COSMO-OWLS models with ΔTAGN = 8.3 and 8.5 respectively'. (5) Only Illustris and cosmo-OWLS-AGN-ΔT8.7 lie beyond the emulator's reach. The text does not quote S(k=1) or S_min as numbers. These values appear only in Figs. 5, 6, 11 and 13, whose y-axes span 0.65/0.75 to 1.10.
